WEBVTT

00:01:30.740 --> 00:01:34.090
The following tale is a work of pure fiction.

00:01:34.110 --> 00:01:37.650
<b> Mid-May 1582 {ts}</b>

00:01:34.110 --> 00:01:37.650
<b> Omi Province Near Azuchi Castle {ts}</b>

00:01:47.270 --> 00:01:49.730
Have a wee taste.

00:01:49.730 --> 00:01:52.370
The first bite belongs to ye, Master Souji.

00:01:52.370 --> 00:01:55.170
I insist, good Governor.

00:02:12.420 --> 00:02:15.960
This overwhelming sourness may be achieved solely by rotten crop...

00:02:16.460 --> 00:02:19.250
Though, 'tis affiliate to fruits moreso than other crop.

00:02:20.880 --> 00:02:24.020
The savory sweetness lies further within, Master Souji.

00:02:35.820 --> 00:02:38.820
The broth requires another hand of seasonings.

00:02:38.820 --> 00:02:42.080
The warriors shall appreciate a broth befitting of their character.

00:02:42.570 --> 00:02:45.290
Master Senno, have ye determined the confections to be served?

00:02:45.760 --> 00:02:47.330
Not quite.

00:02:47.740 --> 00:02:51.690
Then, may I have the honor of serving the confections?

00:02:51.690 --> 00:02:56.090
'Twill humor General Tokugawa into an uproar.

00:02:56.580 --> 00:02:59.080
<b> Dining in Hell {ts}</b>

00:03:02.060 --> 00:03:07.830
Milord has our deepest gratitude for bestowing unto us the administration of Suruga.

00:03:07.830 --> 00:03:14.110
May our service and loyalty beckon forth prosperity unto the clan of Milord.

00:03:14.570 --> 00:03:16.840
Ye've journeyed a distance for the banquet.

00:03:16.840 --> 00:03:21.170
I grant unto ye a respite for touring my domain until Sakai.

00:03:26.750 --> 00:03:28.940
Explain your tattered socks.

00:03:28.940 --> 00:03:33.250
Does Mikawa's treasury suffer so to force its very lord into tatters?

00:03:35.750 --> 00:03:37.160
Milord...

00:03:37.160 --> 00:03:45.020
we expend naught for luxury, as our lands are nurtured by the blood of the people.

00:03:46.340 --> 00:03:50.020
'Tis most proper of a true warrior.

00:03:59.010 --> 00:04:01.610
And should the people behold so sloven a lord,

00:04:01.610 --> 00:04:03.410
dare ye believe joy overcomes them?

00:04:03.840 --> 00:04:05.790
A-Aye.

00:04:07.160 --> 00:04:10.040
Ye have changed little since youthhood.

00:04:10.970 --> 00:04:13.290
Mitsuhide shall cater to ye.

00:04:13.810 --> 00:04:16.940
I shall join ye after dining with regents of the Imperial Court.

00:04:26.700 --> 00:04:28.180
The first course has arrived. {until honzen}

00:04:28.180 --> 00:04:32.340
You have fried sea bream, raw octopus and Crucian carp, {until }

00:04:32.340 --> 00:04:36.110
picked fish and vegetables, and a vegetable broth.

00:04:37.980 --> 00:04:40.050
The course overflows of luxury.

00:04:40.050 --> 00:04:42.150
Luxury is found not sole with food...

00:04:42.150 --> 00:04:44.870
but with gold leaves feathering the pickles.

00:04:48.630 --> 00:04:52.410
I shall cater to your needs.

00:04:52.410 --> 00:04:56.840
Good generals, may ye enjoy this evening.

00:05:00.950 --> 00:05:05.830
The second course features picked sweetfish, broiled eel, an ascidian broth, raw sea cucumber, {until namako}

00:05:05.830 --> 00:05:09.510
abalone, pike conger, and a carp broth. {until koi no shiru ni gozaimasu}

00:05:11.890 --> 00:05:13.310
The third course has arrived. {san no zen}

00:05:13.310 --> 00:05:16.220
You have pheasant, steamed horse crab, river snails,{until watarigani}

00:05:16.220 --> 00:05:18.860
a crane broth, and a sea bass broth.

00:05:20.160 --> 00:05:21.440
The fifth course has arrived. {go no zen}

00:05:21.440 --> 00:05:26.370
You have raw skipjack tuna, burdock roots, shaved kelp, and a duck broth.

00:05:27.550 --> 00:05:28.910
Most exquisite... {kore mo mata}

00:05:31.160 --> 00:05:33.120
I taste naught but madness.

00:05:33.490 --> 00:05:37.870
A mere broth of miso would have sufficed for the evening...

00:05:37.870 --> 00:05:39.270
Opine not displeasure!

00:05:39.270 --> 00:05:40.160
Behold Milord! {miro}

00:05:41.900 --> 00:05:43.940
Withstand this food, as Milord does!

00:05:50.860 --> 00:05:53.060
The general fancies his meals thus far.

00:05:53.850 --> 00:05:54.940
Very well. {kore nara}

00:05:55.410 --> 00:05:57.790
We shall serve the confections!

00:05:58.690 --> 00:06:05.700
Shall those confections entice the character that is Tokugawa Ieyasu?

00:06:06.170 --> 00:06:12.100
'Twill be this moment when the nation shall know of my aesthetic tact! {until tokizo}

00:06:12.710 --> 00:06:15.730
Should General Tokugawa be humored into an uproar, {from tokugawa until kudasareba}

00:06:15.730 --> 00:06:20.160
the entirety of Mikawa and beyond shall know of my name, {from furuta until de arou}

00:06:20.580 --> 00:06:24.090
as the most ingenious aesthete in all of Azuchi! {from azuchi until aritona}

00:06:29.270 --> 00:06:32.760
I am vassal to Milord, Governor Furuta Sasuke.

00:06:32.760 --> 00:06:36.600
I've prepared the pinnacle confection for the evening.

00:06:38.270 --> 00:06:39.610
Ye may serve it.

00:06:48.980 --> 00:06:56.120
'Tis a barbed fruit of Luzon, hollowed and filled with peaches, loquats, and topped with exquisite cream.

00:06:56.550 --> 00:06:59.130
Generals, behold "Mount Azuchi!"

00:07:12.010 --> 00:07:14.280
You accursed imbecile!

00:07:24.040 --> 00:07:26.990
Served knowingly, was this abomination?! {kore ga sokomoto no motenashi de gozaruka}

00:07:30.360 --> 00:07:33.180
Know naught of the path of a true warrior, ye men of Azuchi?! {from azuchi until wasuretaka}

00:07:33.180 --> 00:07:35.500
True warriors require naught of luxury! {until degozarou}

00:07:45.110 --> 00:07:47.630
Ye men insult our dignity as warriors!

00:07:47.630 --> 00:07:50.260
Absolution from such an insult entails {from mikawa bushi until tsugunai to shite}

00:07:50.740 --> 00:07:54.650
that we have Governor Furuta take his own life! {until hoka arumai}

00:08:03.090 --> 00:08:04.450
Be seated!

00:08:14.570 --> 00:08:15.910
Milord...

00:08:23.420 --> 00:08:26.420
Sasuke acts on my behalf.

00:08:43.940 --> 00:08:45.440
Pardon my outburst.

00:08:55.170 --> 00:08:57.470
'Tis indeed a confection of hilarity!

00:08:58.280 --> 00:09:00.160
Milord...

00:09:00.160 --> 00:09:03.760
I shan't leave for Kyoto until after consuming this confection!

00:09:28.580 --> 00:09:31.740
Mori Terumoto dispatches his forces to Bicchu?

00:09:32.240 --> 00:09:34.320
The audacity of the brat.

00:09:34.320 --> 00:09:38.240
He intends to recapture Takamatsu Castle.

00:09:38.600 --> 00:09:41.120
I foresee a troubled Baldy whom shall request aid.

00:09:41.900 --> 00:09:43.330
General Hashiba shall?

00:09:43.820 --> 00:09:46.490
I relieve ye from acting cater to Ieyasu. {until wo toku}

00:09:46.490 --> 00:09:50.540
Dispatch your forces to Bicchu and assist Hideyoshi, post-haste. {until mukae}

00:09:50.540 --> 00:09:53.010
I shall join ye following the ceremony at Honno Temple.

00:09:57.680 --> 00:09:59.520
Protest, do ye?

00:10:00.780 --> 00:10:03.440
I shall return to Sakamoto Castle, Milord.

00:10:03.440 --> 00:10:04.430
Sasuke!

00:10:04.430 --> 00:10:05.020
Aye!

00:10:05.330 --> 00:10:09.720
Relay the order to Generals Hosokawa, Takayama, and Ikeda.

00:10:09.720 --> 00:10:12.740
Ye and your brother shall join them as well.

00:10:18.180 --> 00:10:19.240
Milord...

00:10:30.910 --> 00:10:37.800
I've not once beheld the sight of Milord resting his arm upon furniture. {until ni narareta}

00:10:38.240 --> 00:10:44.430
Daresay, I feel I may never again behold the visage of Milord. {until ki ga itashimashite}

00:10:45.000 --> 00:10:47.810
Attentive to such trivial details aye, Governor Furuta?

00:10:51.960 --> 00:10:54.070
Why utter such trivial concerns?

00:10:57.420 --> 00:11:00.740
My devotion to Milord stems not merely from loyalty,

00:11:00.740 --> 00:11:03.940
but from a lust for masterpieces, serving to fuel my desire for achievements. {until hagemi}

00:11:04.750 --> 00:11:09.040
For without a desire for achievements, I shall attain naught. {until ikite mairimashita}

00:11:11.150 --> 00:11:15.990
Though, the recent audiences with Milord plague my heart with anxiety.

00:11:16.760 --> 00:11:21.960
Perhaps the eventual unification of the land spells the end of my ambitions.

00:11:23.230 --> 00:11:28.340
Akin, are my feelings to the unfortunate General Takigawa Kazumasu. {until douyou}

00:11:28.340 --> 00:11:32.370
Shall Milord send me into barren land as well?

00:11:32.370 --> 00:11:38.360
'Twas these very thoughts of anxiety to which ye conclude as a separation from Milord? {until to}

00:11:38.360 --> 00:11:39.540
Aye.

00:11:40.870 --> 00:11:45.500
Fret not, for Milord enjoys your aesthetic hilarity.

00:11:45.500 --> 00:11:47.870
He shan't exile one who pleases him so.

00:11:48.740 --> 00:11:49.880
Regardless... {saredo}

00:11:55.550 --> 00:11:58.710
neither am I of his kin.

00:11:58.710 --> 00:12:02.140
Fret not, Governor. {until anzuru na}

00:12:02.690 --> 00:12:07.140
Though not of his kin, our exhausted efforts for the sake of Milord {until mukuwareru hi ga}

00:12:07.430 --> 00:12:09.100
shall be rewarded.

00:12:11.630 --> 00:12:13.180
General...

00:12:16.310 --> 00:12:18.690
My gratitude for an audience at so late an hour.

00:12:18.690 --> 00:12:23.000
I sought to atone for my outburst at the banquet.

00:12:38.400 --> 00:12:42.570
'Tis a replicate Muqi painting of a summer camellia from Milord.

00:12:43.020 --> 00:12:44.690
Indeed?

00:12:44.690 --> 00:12:50.390
Though little I retain for knowledge of the arts, astounded am I, by such loyalty to Milord. {until kanpuku itashimasu}

00:12:50.390 --> 00:12:54.940
Do pardon my outburst to so cultured a loyal warrior as ye.

00:12:59.230 --> 00:13:02.610
Ten years have passed...

00:13:03.910 --> 00:13:09.070
since my disgraceful defeat to Takeda Shingen at Mikatagahara. {until ikusa nite}

00:13:09.070 --> 00:13:12.700
Had I not commanded my warriors whilst possessed by rage, {until ugokashitaga tame}

00:13:12.700 --> 00:13:15.130
so severe a defeat would not have been suffered.

00:13:15.500 --> 00:13:19.020
'Twas my defeated visage which was preserved in ink, {until nokoshi}

00:13:19.020 --> 00:13:23.430
and serves as caution against heeding emotion... {until atta no daga}

00:13:25.560 --> 00:13:30.140
However, this was undone by the abomination of Governor Furuta. {until douni mo}

00:13:30.480 --> 00:13:35.480
'Tis my pardon ye seek for your vassals as well, that ye request a secret audience in the eve? {until mairareta to}

00:13:36.150 --> 00:13:40.360
The warriors of Mikawa are blessed with so honorable a lord.

00:13:40.360 --> 00:13:44.810
My vassals and warriors are my very blood, body, and soul. {until ete gozaru}

00:13:44.810 --> 00:13:47.860
I shan't serve as a proper lord without them.

00:13:47.860 --> 00:13:51.660
For the sake of peace, I shan't fail their loyalty.

00:13:55.340 --> 00:14:01.800
Refer ye to the observed treatment of Milord to his vassals?

00:14:03.150 --> 00:14:07.050
'Twas strict to my domain of Mikawa.

00:14:08.960 --> 00:14:12.940
Then I shall speak strict of my own domain as well.

00:14:16.360 --> 00:14:19.410
'Twas in the midst of war, was I born.

00:14:20.400 --> 00:14:22.280
Exhausted, am I from war. {mohaya tsukarehatemashita}

00:14:23.160 --> 00:14:29.050
Though the Horyu Temple of Yamato stands for a millennia, not has it wasted away. {until kitsuritsushite orimasu}

00:14:29.050 --> 00:14:33.200
A domain, alike Horyu Temple, is crafted by people. {until tsukurishimono}

00:14:33.200 --> 00:14:38.340
Withstand a millennia desiring peace, and peace ye may have post-millennia. {until arimasenu}

00:14:39.470 --> 00:14:44.360
Assured is the peace of a domain, should the efforts of a Lord's subjects be rewarded. {until kundukuri ga hissu}

00:14:44.360 --> 00:14:49.930
Therefore, my life is one to take for the sake of my domain and its people! {from sonotamenara until ni gozaru}

00:15:19.690 --> 00:15:21.680
Refreshing, was the tea.

00:15:21.680 --> 00:15:25.540
My gratitude for so honest a flavor, General.

00:15:26.820 --> 00:15:28.060
Have this.

00:15:49.290 --> 00:15:53.260
Adorn these finer socks upon the journey to Kyoto.

00:15:53.260 --> 00:15:59.240
Though ye prefer tatters, your vassals shall suffer the merry towards ye.

00:16:53.220 --> 00:16:55.150
Milord, I beg of thee a thousand pardons!

00:16:55.150 --> 00:16:59.310
Shiranui is a most obedient hawk whom I've nurtured so! {until meio}

00:16:59.310 --> 00:17:04.550
Milord, I shall gladly accept punishment, but I beg of thee to spare the hawk!

00:17:08.680 --> 00:17:10.590
Ye have control of our forces.

00:17:10.590 --> 00:17:13.050
Proceed as arranged.

00:17:21.170 --> 00:17:22.830
Take caution, Brother.

00:17:23.360 --> 00:17:26.010
Nay caution, for the Heavens favor my rule.

00:17:26.010 --> 00:17:29.340
Behold the flood which drowns Takamatsu Castle.

00:17:30.560 --> 00:17:34.310
This blessed rain followed the destruction of the dam.

00:17:34.310 --> 00:17:37.160
I wish to preserve this visage of victory in ink.

00:17:38.440 --> 00:17:43.390
Once completed, I shall have it hanged in the tea room.

00:17:45.320 --> 00:17:51.360
In order to receive Milord safely, Brother has departed with 5,000 warriors to Himeji Castle. {until shuttatsu shita}

00:17:51.820 --> 00:17:53.360
He has?! {nanto}

00:17:53.700 --> 00:17:57.990
Until they return, I have absolute command over our forces.

00:17:58.560 --> 00:18:02.750
Consider my orders that of my brother's.

00:18:03.310 --> 00:18:07.870
Hither, are we to securing Mori's surrender! {until oozume to iu no ni}

00:18:07.870 --> 00:18:11.510
Should they learn of General Hashiba's absence...!

00:18:11.510 --> 00:18:14.460
Then who, if not my brother, shall receive Milord?!

00:18:14.460 --> 00:18:17.010
Milord ventures toward unfamiliar territory! {from youyaku until uesama wo}

00:18:19.280 --> 00:18:25.520
Then the General's absence must remain secret as we continue negotiations. {until shika arumai}

00:18:26.050 --> 00:18:31.230
Upon Milord's arrival, perhaps they shall surrender unconditionally.

00:18:31.680 --> 00:18:36.910
Brother shall return together with Milord early into the sixth month.

00:18:37.870 --> 00:18:42.660
Until he returns, I ask of ye to obey my commands.

00:18:45.520 --> 00:18:50.770
The strategic point for battle would be near the entrance to Kyoto, at the village of Oyamazaki. {until ooyamazaki}

00:18:50.770 --> 00:18:54.530
Suppressing reinforcements from Settsu shall be the most essential of tasks.

00:18:55.580 --> 00:18:57.680
However, two concerns remain. {nokoru fuan wa futatsu}

00:18:57.680 --> 00:19:01.020
The featured masterpieces of the present proprietors,

00:19:01.020 --> 00:19:04.560
and whether Akechi will move to assassinate Milord.

00:19:05.420 --> 00:19:10.160
His scarred and ripened hands are those of exhaustion.

00:19:11.040 --> 00:19:15.570
'Twas to a warrior clan was he born to.

00:19:16.270 --> 00:19:19.680
Though his hands be worn and pristine, shall he dirty his hands with rebellion?

00:19:21.580 --> 00:19:22.910
Wait here. {sukoshi mattero}

00:19:24.080 --> 00:19:25.870
We need to secure the supplies. {oroshitamono wo mitemairimasu}

00:19:25.870 --> 00:19:27.040
Thank you, kindly. {a suman na}

00:19:27.320 --> 00:19:31.950
"Our exhausted efforts for the sake of Milord shall be rewarded." {until ka}

00:19:32.910 --> 00:19:36.090
Though I am grateful for such assurance...

00:19:46.500 --> 00:19:48.900
Beloved, come with me.

00:20:00.990 --> 00:20:03.860
I requested General Hosokawa Tadaoki for an armor set,

00:20:03.860 --> 00:20:08.420
and he asked an Iwai armor master from Kyoto to craft this set.

00:20:11.150 --> 00:20:13.940
'Twas exactly akin to the visage I had imagined! {until toori no}

00:20:14.570 --> 00:20:16.420
A bindweed-shaped helmet,

00:20:16.970 --> 00:20:20.430
and a polished, thin plate of Bodhi armor!

00:20:22.680 --> 00:20:23.450
Beloved Osen!

00:20:25.350 --> 00:20:28.300
Control now 400 koku worth of properties, beloved. {until desukara}

00:20:28.300 --> 00:20:33.440
A suitable armor, which shall guarantee your life, is necessary for such a warrior. {until nareba}

00:20:44.460 --> 00:20:45.250
Catch! {sore}

00:20:45.250 --> 00:20:45.700
Oh! {itai}

00:20:48.500 --> 00:20:49.480
Osen!

00:21:07.800 --> 00:21:09.000
Children. {kora}

00:21:09.000 --> 00:21:11.100
Do play outside.

00:21:11.940 --> 00:21:13.100
Okay! {sore}

00:21:47.600 --> 00:21:49.850
I feel my ambition restored.

00:21:56.320 --> 00:22:01.810
Should my lust be satiated, I resume the pursuit of "Lord."

00:22:12.800 --> 00:22:13.780
Aye... {sou da}

00:22:15.490 --> 00:22:19.700
I must do naught but achieve feats!

00:22:20.540 --> 00:22:21.960
'Tis simple. {hitasura ni}

00:22:26.190 --> 00:22:31.130
Regardless of what may occur henceforth...

00:22:52.030 --> 00:23:00.130
<b> Late May 1582 {ts}</b>

00:22:55.190 --> 00:23:00.130
<b> Kyoto {ts}</b>

00:22:56.580 --> 00:23:00.130
<b> Honno Temple {ts}</b>

00:24:34.630 --> 00:24:36.350
<b> Surely, you jest {bl ts}</b>

00:24:48.120 --> 00:24:49.780
<b> My undying gratitude to ye {yel ts}</b>

00:24:50.480 --> 00:24:52.750
License to Cruelty.

00:24:53.320 --> 00:24:58.300
Does the fork joining the aesthete and warrior exist?

00:24:56.670 --> 00:24:59.820
<b> License to Cruelty {ts}</b>
